  "gloss": "to tile or thatch a roof",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to tile or thatch a roof",
      "explanation": "To cover a roof with tiles, thatch, or shingles. Used specifically for construction or covering of a roof surface, as in {屋根|やね}を{葺|ふ}く."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "30860_fuku_ex1",
      "japanese": "⟦{屋根|やね}→屋根：02264_yane⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{葺|ふ}く。",
      "english": "To tile a roof.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "30860_fuku_ex2",
      "japanese": "{茅|かや}⟦で→で：00502_de⟧⟦{屋根|やね}→屋根：02264_yane⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{葺|ふ}いた。",
      "english": "They thatched the roof with thatch reed.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "30860_fuku_ex3",
      "japanese": "⟦この→この：00962_kono⟧⟦{地方|ちほう}→地方：02369_chihou⟧⟦で→で：00502_de⟧⟦は→は：00079_ha⟧⟦{今|いま}でも→今でも：20772_imademo⟧{茅|かや}⟦で→で：00502_de⟧⟦{屋根|やね}→屋根：02264_yane⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{葺|ふ}く⟦{家|いえ}→家：00612_ie⟧がある。",
      "english": "In this region, there are still houses whose roofs are thatched with reed.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Pattern: ⟦{屋根|やね}→屋根：02264_yane⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{葺|ふ}く\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{瓦|かわら}→瓦：03902_kawara⟧⟦で→で：00502_de⟧⟦{屋根|やね}→屋根：02264_yane⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{葺|ふ}く: to tile a roof with roof tiles\n- {茅|かや}⟦で→で：00502_de⟧⟦{屋根|やね}→屋根：02264_yane⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{葺|ふ}く: to thatch a roof with reed\n- ⟦{葺|ふ}き{替|か}える→葺き替える：30861_fukikaeru⟧: to re-tile / re-roof (replace an old covering)\n\nWATCH OUT:\nHomophone of ⟦{吹|ふ}く→吹く：02445_fuku⟧ (to blow) and ⟦{噴|ふ}く→噴く：26557_fuku⟧ (to spout, to erupt); {葺|ふ}く is specific to roofing and far less common outside that context.",
